Subject: Compile the complete original lighting providers with native data ABI
Upstream-base: 2c5c51e483b652d178ef06a44b83b07a0f97d2a6

Restore original GameObjectLight declarations, its three-flag constructor and
the original LightingLookup class in the non-diagnostic native source graph.
Retain prior extracted records/state only for the explicit diagnostic graph.
Original methods, static requests, lookup allocation/free order, cache decisions
and light/shadow equations remain authoritative, including retail quirks.

Use canonical native GX/MTX declarations and the existing native matrix handle.
Adapt source four-byte RGBA aliases and raw big-endian GX palette reads below
the original methods. Every console source projection is preserved. This patch
does not qualify actual source initialization, resource loading or GPU drawing.

